{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed front extension, by virtue of its design, form, bulk, width, scale and siting, would represent a dominant and obtrusive form of development that fails to relate to, or appear subservient to, the original dwelling. It would be disproportionate to the established character, form and pattern of development along Green Road and would be detrimental to the visual amenities of both the subject property and the surrounding area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Core Strategy (2010) Policy CP30, and Policies DMD 6, DMD 8 and DMD 37 of the Development Management Document (2014), as well as the National Planning Policy Framework (2025), which collectively seek to ensure that new development is of high quality, appropriately scaled, and respectful of local character."
